This Visual Attribution Requirement must satisfy the following strict visibility criteria:
1. Prominence: The attribution must be displayed directly on the primary, default
   user-facing interface (such as the main application window header, top navigation
   bar, or prominent main dashboard view).
2. Non-Hiding and Legibility: It is strictly prohibited to hide, obscure, minimize,
   or bury this attribution in obscure sub-menus, settings drawers, hidden about dialogs,
   collapsed sidebars, microscopic footers, or corners with low contrast.
3. Interactive Link: Where an interactive graphical user interface is present, the
   attribution text must include a clickable link leading directly to the original repository.

